      "mapName": "Gem1.h3m",
      "regionText": "You have agreed to help a wizard's apprentice named Sandro.  Sandro's master, Ethric, needs an Amulet of the Undertaker to perform anti-necromancy research, but Ethric is an academician and Sandro is too inexperienced to go after the Amulet himself.",
